        "headline": {
          "en": "Temur Spellementals",
          "zh": "铁木尔元素"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "Compared with common Spellementals builds, this list leans more controlling while retaining the Eddymurk Crab + Sunderflock package. Splashing green for Analyze the Pollen also gives it access to a creature tutor in the late game. Personally, though, I am not convinced the green splash adds enough value through its assortment of one-ofs.",
          "zh": "相比纯元素套牌更倾向于控制，不过还是保留了黯潮蟹+驱群妖的配合，进绿带的分析花粉一定程度上后期也可以导生物。不过个人感觉进绿为了各种单张单卡收益可能不是特别大。"
        },
